    <Segment StartTime="1.250" EndTime="3.900" Participant="me011">Okay , so <VocalSound Description="breath"/> Jane , are we recording ?</Segment>
    <Segment StartTime="3.950" EndTime="5.100" Participant="fe016">Yeah , we are .</Segment>
    <Segment StartTime="5.200" EndTime="9.870" Participant="me011">Great . <Comment Description="referring to the board"/> So Morgan wanted the numbers by Friday <Pause/> right ?</Segment>
    <Segment StartTime="9.900" EndTime="10.400" Participant="fe016"><VocalSound Description="laugh"/></Segment>
    <Segment StartTime="10.450" EndTime="14.000" Participant="fe016">Mm-hmm . Liz said she'd send them .</Segment>
